	dc:source	pwn30:01199365-n .

<i41672>	a	<Concept> ;
	skos:definition	"(law) a proceeding (usually by a court) where evidence is taken for the purpose of determining an issue of fact and reaching a decision based on that evidence"@en ;
	dc:source	pwn30:01199697-n .

