<i69050>	a	<Concept> ;
	skos:definition	"the theological doctrine that by faith and God's grace a Christian is freed from all laws (including the moral standards of the culture)"@en ;
	dc:source	pwn30:06187154-n .

<i69051>	a	<Concept> ;
	skos:definition	"the comprehensive theological doctrine created by Saint Thomas Aquinas in the 13th century and still taught by the Dominicans"@en ;
	dc:source	pwn30:06187350-n .

