	skos:definition	"medium-sized two-needled pine of southern Europe having a spreading crown; widely cultivated for its sweet seeds that resemble almonds"@en ;
	dc:source	pwn30:11611758-n .

<i98402>	a	<Concept> ;
	skos:definition	"large five-needled European pine; yields cembra nuts and a resinous exudate"@en ;
	dc:source	pwn30:11612018-n .

