	skos:definition	"a hardy genus of terrestrial orchids of Europe and northern Africa and western Asia"@en ;
	dc:source	pwn30:12074678-n .

<i100614>	a	<Concept> ;
	skos:definition	"European orchid whose flowers resemble bumble bees in shape and color"@en ;
