	skos:definition	"large genus of epiphytic or lithophytic orchids of tropical America"@en ;
	dc:source	pwn30:12079352-n .

<i100637>	a	<Concept> ;
	skos:definition	"any of numerous small tufted orchids of the genus Pleurothallis having leathery to fleshy leaves and racemes of 1 to many small flowers"@en ;
	dc:source	pwn30:12079523-n .

